<title>USA: CCC seeks 25,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 25,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it is seeking 25,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the export donation program for Bosnia.</p>
<p>Shipment is slated for October 5-31 and bids are due on September 17.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
